patch:
--- a/main.tex
+++ b/main.tex
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@
 \\subsection{The failing operation}
 The project intended to emphasize the following phrase with a local command.
 That command was renamed elsewhere and this call site retained the old name.
-\\widgitize{important text}
+\\widgetize{important text}

 The text after the failure is also ordinary. It ensures the source window is
 centered instead of merely consuming the remainder of a tiny fixture.

